---
title: Billing
sidebar:
  order: 7
---
The Billing section lets you securely manage your Taskip subscription, review usage limits, and track billing details.\
\
From here, you can monitor your current plan, upgrade your subscription, and understand how your workspace resources are being used.

### **Navigation Path**

**Settings → Billing**

![](./billing/content/image-93-1024x261.png)

### **Current Subscription**

This section displays details of your active plan, including:

- **Plan Name** (e.g., Team Lifetime, Monthly Subscription)
- Price and billing cycle
- **Next Payment Date** (if applicable)

![](./billing/content/image-93-1024x261.png)

### **Change Billing Cycle**

If you want to update how you’re billed, use this option to switch your subscription plan.

1. Click **Upgrade Plan** to explore available options
1. Click **Switch to yearly plan (or monthly)** to change billing frequency

![](./billing/content/image-93-1024x261.png)

3. Select a plan or upgrade you want by clicking Choose Plan.

![](./billing/content/image-96.png)

4. Provide all the required information, complete payment, and click Subscribe for confirmation.&nbsp;

![](./billing/content/image-97-1024x890.png)

### **Usage Overview: Manage and Monitor Usage**

The [Usage section provides a real-time overview](https://taskip.net/docs/how-do-i-manage-and-monitor-usage/) of how much of your plan’s resources you’ve used and what remains available.

Each usage item displays:

- **Used amount:** What your workspace has consumed
- **Total limit:** Based on your subscription plan
- **Usage percentage:** How much of the limit is used
- **Remaining capacity:** Available resources left

![](./billing/content/image-321.png)

It includes:&nbsp;

- **Storage**:&nbsp;Shows total storage used and remaining space (e.g., 0 GB / 5 GB).
- **Email Aliases**:&nbsp;Tracks the number of email aliases created in your workspace.
- **AI Tokens**:&nbsp;Displays AI usage. Unlimited plans show no usage restrictions.
- **Team Members**:&nbsp;Indicates how many team members are added to your workspace.
- **Workspaces**:&nbsp;Shows the number of active workspaces versus the allowed limit.
- **Teams**:&nbsp;Tracks team creation and usage.
- **Contacts**:&nbsp;Displays the total number of contacts stored.
- **Documents**:&nbsp;Tracks documents created and stored.
- **Tasks**:&nbsp;Shows task usage for workspaces with task limits.
- **Forms**:&nbsp;Tracks form creation and usage.
- **Deals**:&nbsp;Displays deal usage and remaining capacity

![](./billing/content/image-98-1024x347.png)

**Notes**\
\* Features marked&nbsp;**Unlimited**&nbsp;have no usage limits.\
\* Usage updates automatically as your workspace grows.\
\* If you approach a limit, consider upgrading your plan to avoid interruptions.

### Viewing Invoices

You can access and manage your billing history directly from the Invoices tab.

- Go to the **Invoices** tab in Billing.

![](./billing/content/image-98-1024x347.png)

- View your complete invoice history
- Download invoices for your records or accounting purposes
